WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.837
Step 3.

00:00:01.787 --> 00:00:11.500
The 50 billion dollar Maple Fund was pitched to Ottawa in September 2024 while Carney was Trudeau's economic adviser and still Brookfield board chair.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.737
It received limited pension fund interest.

00:00:14.737 --> 00:00:21.362
Then Carney became PM and launched a 51 billion dollar government fund covering the same sectors.
